d.\n\nUpcoming features:\n- Multi-line hexadecimal input through command line\n- Pastebin support\n- Documentation (?)", "created_at": "2017-09-27T00:16:03Z", "repo": "Converter", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c16dbb5db1435b449228c7cd9ad62aabb965f8f7", "message": "Updated dead links in the test file.\n\nThe builds were failing due to some dead links in the test file.", "created_at": "2017-05-19T18:58:54Z", "repo": "Converter", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7252ae1f7ca836704c4d0af8a5596b3e825cf137", "message": "Added a custom update dialog + bug fixes.\n\n- Added a window that asks the user and asks if they want to the see the\nonline patch notes.\n- Made the GUI and command line version have different configs and they\nare both stored in the data folder.\n- Added the method of creating the log folder in the command line\nversion, so the program would not become unstable.\n- Added the licenses for all the open source libraries this program\nuses.\n- Fixed linux shebang line to the correct version of python. (In the\ncommand line version.)\nThe bug fixes include:\n- When a messagebox appeared, a blank tk window would show up. (Fixed by\ncreating a blank tk window when the program starts, but it is\nwithdrawn.)\n- The license window would not fit all of the text on the screen. (Made\nit a little bigger.)\n-  The license window text box would cut off at a certain point when the\nwindow was extended. (Made the textbox the window size.)", "created_at": "2017-03-11T22:42:31Z", "repo": "Converter", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "da7739c6445ab7a2e6da65ff09cad8de3909c813", "message": "Adding placeholders for documentation and help\n\nAdding some placeholders. Nothing special, for now.", "created_at": "2017-02-17T13:24:52Z", "repo": "Converter", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "277839b6f8